## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: XayaUI Nameplates
## Notes: Changes to Blizzard's own nameplates: your target's health bar in a colour you choose. Disabled until you enable it in the AddOns list, so it costs nothing until then. Shows nothing while Plater (or another nameplate addon) replaces Blizzard's plates. Needs XayaUI.
